definitely something I'd go again.

00:00:43.505 --> 00:00:44.828
- Thanks, Filipinos.

00:00:44.828 --> 00:00:46.424
I now have eaten pig's ears.

00:00:46.424 --> 00:00:47.464
- Are they like a super food?

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:49.513
Will I get like really good skin?

00:00:52.178 --> 00:00:53.200
