00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:53.920
No I can't say that.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.003
That sounds so bogan.

00:00:55.003 --> 00:00:56.878
- Oh, I can smell it already.

00:00:56.878 --> 00:00:59.872
It's something mysterious about this one.

00:00:59.872 --> 00:01:00.767
I'm nervous.

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:01.881
- You're nervous?

00:01:01.881 --> 00:01:03.057
It's just chicken!

00:01:04.148 --> 00:01:05.895
- It tastes like teriyaki chicken,

00:01:05.895 --> 00:01:08.128
like you know the chicken
inside the sushi rolls?

00:01:08.128 --> 00:01:09.104
- Yeah, I know all of that.

00:01:09.104 --> 00:01:09.594
- Yeah.

00:01:09.594 --> 00:01:10.815
- I think it's really good.

00:01:10.815 --> 00:01:12.322
I think that this is a hero.

00:01:13.256 --> 00:01:14.918
- Sinigang na Hipon.

00:01:14.918 --> 00:01:15.894
It's like clars?

00:01:15.894 --> 00:01:18.677
- There are two huge prawns
in the middle of this bowl.

00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:20.530
I honestly wouldn't even
know how to shell a prawn.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:21.030
- Okay.

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:21.974
- I'm such a bad Australian.

00:01:21.974 --> 00:01:23.353
