00:01:23.353 --> 00:01:23.955
- Alright.

00:01:24.955 --> 00:01:28.103
- Sweat from a boot poured
into a bowl (laughs).

00:01:28.103 --> 00:01:29.900
- Sweat from a boot?

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.634
