down, eating this soup,

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:33.112
you're gonna be like eating soup,

00:01:33.112 --> 00:01:35.060
but then also shelling prawns,

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:36.401
and then going back to eating a soup.

00:01:36.401 --> 00:01:37.891
- It's just a tasty prawn.

00:01:37.891 --> 00:01:40.373
